# Dockerfile-specific context for the joint E2E Soland image.
# The umbrella workspace .dockerignore intentionally excludes Soland, while
# this Dockerfile copies exactly Soland and its sibling Rust SDK path dependency.
*
!arkret-rust-sdk/
!arkret-rust-sdk/**
!arkret-spec/
!arkret-spec/**
!soland/
!soland/**

**/target/
**/.git/
**/.claude/
**/.github/
**/.gitea/
**/.devcontainer/
**/.codex-*.log
**/*.log
